            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 19.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the fifth day of the fourth month of the thirtieth year,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "thirtieth year",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": It is not known to what year this refers.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I, Ezekiel the priest, son of Buzi, was living with the Jewish exiles by the River Chebar in Babylonia. The sky opened, and I saw a vision of God. ( ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.10+2KI.24.11+2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kgs 24.10–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.9+2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Chr 36.9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was the fifth year since King Jehoiachin had been taken into exile.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There in Babylonia beside the River Chebar, I heard the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " speak to me and I felt his power.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked up and saw a storm coming from the north. Lightning was flashing from a huge cloud, and the sky round it was glowing. Where the lightning was flashing, something shone like bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 4.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the centre of the storm, I saw what looked like four living creatures in human form, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but each of them had four faces and four wings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their legs were straight, and they had hoofs like those of a bull. They shone like polished bronze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In addition to their four faces and four wings, they each had four human hands, one under each wing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Two wings of each creature were spread out so that the creatures formed a square with their wing tips touching. When they moved, they moved as a group without turning their bodies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
