          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There under the dome stood the creatures, each stretching out two wings towards the ones next to it and covering its body with the other two wings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
