              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I heard the noise their wings made in flight; it sounded like the roar of the sea, like the noise of a huge army, like the voice of Almighty God. When they stopped flying, they folded their wings, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.24"
            ]
